{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21716","headline":"赠别杨员外巨源 · 元稹","name":"赠别杨员外巨源","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昔西河县下时，青山顦顇宦名卑。\n揄扬陶令缘求酒，结托萧娘只在诗。\n朱紫衣裳浮世重，苍黄岁序长年悲。\n白头後会知何日，一盏烦君不用辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21716.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21716","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}